            <ArticleTitle>[Effectiveness of infiltration anesthesia of postoperative abdominal wound using bupivacaine solution for alleviation of postoperative pain].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>223-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In a group of 40 patients after abdominal operations a high effectiveness was noted of infiltrations anaesthesia of the postoperative wound with 0.5% bupivacaine solution for alleviation of pain and reduction of requirements for narcotics in early postoperative period (randomized study).</AbstractText>
